2. Select the operator token kind by check variant — `T![===]` for `Zero`, `T![>]` for `NonZero`.

3. Build the replacement binary expression. The left operand is `member_expr.clone().trim_trailing_trivia()?.into()`; the operator uses `make::token_decorated_with_space(operator_kind)`; the right operand is a number literal `"0"`:
